    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "0539819d4a9b0c7d4952": "Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.",
        "154e32e91a57d3e22ce3": "Greetings mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?",
        "548407508ebb68a0f1fe": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "65934f592e2fc4b2b19a": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "bcd9c518578ee404a5f2": "I am interested in mage training."
      },
      "name": "Maginor Dumas",
      "subName": "Master Mage",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
